Since the graph of $y = 3 \sin \left( x - \frac{\pi}{5} \right)$ is the same as the graph of $y = 3 \sin x$ shifted $\frac{\pi}{5}$ units to the right, the phase shift is $\boxed{\frac{\pi}{5}}.$

[asy]import TrigMacros;

